# third-party code-graph scan output: regenerable, never committed
graphify-out/

# agent-to-agent handoff coordination artifacts at the repo root: transient, never part of a
# reviewed candidate. Anchored to root and suffix-specific so it cannot match the governed
# docs/02-agents/HANDOFF-CONTRACT.md.
/HANDOFF-*-TO-CODEX.md

